The released weights and inference code are licensed under Apache-2.0.

The frozen text encoder is Qwen3.5-9B, using WanGP's existing Qwen
implementation and its preserved upstream license notices. The unused
vision tower is omitted. Q/gate projection rows are stored in separate
contiguous groups in the WanGP encoder checkpoint.

The FLUX.2 small VAE decoder reuses WanGP's FLUX autoencoder implementation.
The unused image encoder is omitted from the prepared decoder checkpoint.
